<title>UK: BADMINTON-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS WOMEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS WOMEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of women's singles matches at the world individual badminton championships on Wednesday (prefix number dentoes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Ye Zhaoying (China) beat Lisa Campbell (Australia)  11-1 11-1</p>
<p>16-Cindana (Indonesia) beat Marina Andrievskaya (Sweden) 11-7 11-12 11-3</p>
<p>8-Ra Kyung-min (South Korea) beat Anne Sondergaard (Denmark) 11-6 11-4</p>
<p>15-Dai Yun (China) beat Vlada Tcheniavskaya (Belarus) 11-0 11-0</p>
<p>3-Mia Audina (Indonesia) beat Katarazyna Krasowska (Poland) 11-8 11-1</p>
<p>13-Yao Yan (China) beat Ishwani Boopathy (Malaysia) 11-1 11-1</p>
<p>6-Wang Chen (China) beat Pomsawan Plungwech (Taiwan)  11-1 11-9</p>
<p>11-Lee Joo-hyun (South Korea) beat Koon Wai Chee (Hong Kong) 11-0 11-6.</p>
</text>
